### ============================================================
### BluePrints API – Parte 2 (JWT)
### Cliente HTTP de IntelliJ: ejecutar las peticiones en orden.
### Los scripts > {% %} guardan los tokens en variables globales.
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{host}}/api/v1/blueprints

### 1. Login student (solo blueprints.read)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "student123"
}

> {% client.global.set("student_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. Login assistant (blueprints.read + blueprints.write)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "assistant",
  "password": "assistant123"
}

> {% client.global.set("assistant_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. Login con contrasena incorrecta -> 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "equivocada"
}

### 4. Listar todos (student) -> 200
GET {{api}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 5. Blueprints de un autor -> 200
GET {{api}}/john
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 6. Blueprint especifico -> 200
GET {{api}}/john/house
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 7. Autor inexistente -> 404
GET {{api}}/nobody
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 8. Crear blueprint con student -> 403 (scope insuficiente)
POST {{api}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "student",
  "name": "no-permitido",
  "points": [ { "x": 1, "y": 1 } ]
}

### 9. Crear blueprint con assistant -> 201 (repetirla da 409)
POST {{api}}
Authorization: Bearer {{assistant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "assistant",
  "name": "oficina",
  "points": [ { "x": 0, "y": 0 }, { "x": 5, "y": 0 }, { "x": 5, "y": 5 } ]
}

### 10. Agregar punto con assistant -> 202
PUT {{api}}/assistant/oficina/points
Authorization: Bearer {{assistant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "x": 0, "y": 5 }

### 10b. Reemplazar todos los puntos (PUT completo) con assistant -> 200
PUT {{api}}/assistant/oficina
Authorization: Bearer {{assistant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "assistant",
  "name": "oficina",
  "points": [ { "x": 0, "y": 0 }, { "x": 8, "y": 0 }, { "x": 8, "y": 8 }, { "x": 0, "y": 8 } ]
}

### 10c. PUT completo con student -> 403
PUT {{api}}/john/house
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": [ { "x": 1, "y": 1 } ] }

### 10d. Eliminar con student -> 403
DELETE {{api}}/assistant/oficina
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 10e. Eliminar con assistant -> 200 (repetirla da 404)
DELETE {{api}}/assistant/oficina
Authorization: Bearer {{assistant_token}}

### 11. Datos invalidos -> 400
POST {{api}}
Authorization: Bearer {{assistant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "", "name": "sin-autor" }

### 12. Sin token -> 401
GET {{api}}

### 13. Health (publico) -> 200
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
